ons_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2019-05-13T18:44:51Z","updated_at":"2019-06-18T15:55:25Z","closed_at":"2019-06-18T15:55:25Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Consider this test case:\r\n```\r\n[case testNewAnalyzerImportFromTopLevelAlias]\r\nimport a.b\r\n[file a/__init__.py]\r\nfrom .b import B\r\nfrom . import b as c\r\nb = int\r\nx: Forward\r\nclass Forward:\r\n    ...\r\n\r\n[file a/b.py]\r\nclass B: ...\r\n[builtins fixtures/module.pyi]\r\n```\r\nIt currently fails with `Name 'c' is already defined`, because on the first iteration mypy sees `a.b` as module, while on the second one it is a type alias. There is also a similar but different test case:\r\n```\r\n[case testNewAnalyzerImportFromTopLevelFunction]\r\nimport a.b\r\n[file a/__init__.py]\r\nfrom .b import B\r\nfrom . import b as c\r\ndef b(): ...  # can be also b: int\r\nx: Forward\r\nclass Forward:\r\n    ...\r\n\r\n[file a/b.py]\r\nclass B: ...\r\n[builtins fixtures/module.pyi]\r\n```\r\nthat fails with `Name 'b' already defined` for a similar reason. Note that we already added some special casing for a similar scenario, see https://github.com/python/mypy/pull/6630, to match old semantic analyzer (and also Python runtime). Setting priority to high since this causes problems with internal deployment of new analyzer. @JukkaL I assign this to you since this may be related to tracking the order of definitions.","closed_by":{"login":"JukkaL","id":1107911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDc5MTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1107911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL","html_url":"https://github.com/JukkaL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JukkaL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/6828/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/6828/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}